raw_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* obesity, according to the IOTF criteria;
* waist circumference ≥ 90th percentile;
* diet naïve or with failure of weight loss (defined as -1 kg/m2 BMI in 1 year).

Exclusion Criteria:

* specific causes of endocrine or genetic obesity;
* type 1 diabetes;
* previous kidney diseases.
